                                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>Follow-up Guarantee:</strong> 12 months post-treatment follow-up included</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-start">
                                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>Emergency Protocol:</strong> Immediate transfer to international hospital if needed</span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
