                                    <span><strong>All-Inclusive Pricing:</strong> Treatment, hospital stay, medications, follow-up included</span>
                                </li>
                                <li class="flex items-start">
                                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-1 mr-2"></i>
                                    <span><strong>Price Lock Guarantee:</strong> Quoted price is final, no hidden fees</span>
